<title>ITALY: Four new shares to join Milan's Mib30 blue chips.</title>
<headline>Four new shares to join Milan's Mib30 blue chips.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banca Fideuram, Mediaset, Mediolanum and Saipem will enter the Milan stock exchange's Mib30 blue chip index on September 25, the Bourse Council said.</p>
<p>The council, which revises the index twice a year and is based on market capitalisation, said the new stocks will replace Ambroveneto, Compart, Ifi and Ifil.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
